demandes d''avis pour l''App Store","Compatibilité avec les Outils de Développement comme React et Python"],"de":["Anpassbare Auslösebedingungen","Plattformerkennung","Zeitlogik","Integration mit StoreKit","Generierung von Bewertungsanfragen für den App Store","Kompatibilität mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Python"],"pt":["Geração de pedidos de revisão inteligentes","Detecção de plataforma para a App Store","Lógica de temporização adequada para pedidos de revisão","Integração com StoreKit review e SKStoreReviewController","Configuração de gatilhos para pedidos de revisão"],"ru":["Генерация умных запросов отзывов","Обнаружение платформы для App Store","Правильная логика тайминга для запросов отзывов","Интеграция с StoreKit review и SKStoreReviewController","Настройка триггеров для запросов отзывов"],"ar":["مولد طلبات مراجعة ذكية","الكشف عن المنصة لمتجر التطبيقات","منطق الزمن المناسب لطلبات المراجعة","التكامل مع StoreKit review و SKStoreReviewController","إعداد المحددات لطلبات المراجعة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use review-prompt","what is review-prompt","review-prompt alternative","review-prompt vs StoreKit","review-prompt install","review-prompt setup guide","App Store review prompting","configurable trigger conditions","platform detection for reviews"],"zh":["Review-Prompt","App Store 评论提示","触发条件","平台检测","时序逻辑","StoreKit Review","SKStoreReviewController","AIエージェント"],"ja":["Review-Prompt","App Store レビュー促進","トリガー条件","プラットフォーム検出","タイミングロジック","StoreKit Review","SKStoreReviewController","AIエージェント"],"ko":["리뷰 프롬프트","앱스토어 리뷰 요청","트리거 조건","플랫폼 감지","타이밍 로직","StoreKit Review","SKStoreReviewController","AI 에이전트"],"es":["Review Prompt","generador de solicitudes de revisión","App Store","StoreKit","detección de plataforma","lógica de temporización","herramientas de desarrollo","React","Python","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Review Prompt","générateur de demandes d''avis","App Store","StoreKit","détection de plateforme","logique de temporisation","outils de développement","React","Python","développement d''applications mobiles"],"de":["Review Prompt","Generator für Bewertungsanfragen","App Store","StoreKit","Plattformerkennung","Zeitlogik","Entwicklungstools","React","Python","Mobile-App-Entwicklung"],"pt":["review-prompt","gerador de pedidos de revisão","App Store","detecção de plataforma","lógica de temporização","StoreKit review","SKStoreReviewController","configuração de gatilhos"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Review-Prompt","генератор умных запросов отзывов","App Store","обнаружение платформы","логика тайминга","StoreKit review","SKStoreReviewController","настройка триггеров"],"ar":["Review-Prompt","مولد طلبات مراجعة","متجر التطبيقات","الكشف عن المنصة","منطق الزمن","StoreKit review","SKStoreReviewController","إعداد المحددات"]}},"owner":"rshankras","repo":"claude-code-apple-skills","repoPath":"rshankras/claude-code-apple-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-prompt","description":"Generates smart App Store review prompt infrastructure with configurable conditions and platform detection. Use when user wants to add review prompts, request ratings, or implement StoreKit reviews.","bodyPreview":"# Review Prompt Generator\n\nGenerate smart App Store review prompting with configurable trigger conditions, platform detection, and proper timing logic.\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n- Asks to \"add review prompt\" or \"request reviews\"\n- Mentions \"App Store rating\" or \"app reviews\"\n- Wants to \"prompt for ratings\" or \"ask for reviews\"\n- Asks about \"StoreKit review\" or \"SKStoreReviewController\"\n\n## Platform Detection (CRITICAL)\n\n**This skill only applies to App Store di","body":"# Review Prompt Generator\n\nGenerate smart App Store review prompting with configurable trigger conditions, platform detection, and proper timing logic.\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n- Asks to \"add review prompt\" or \"request reviews\"\n- Mentions \"App Store rating\" or \"app reviews\"\n- Wants to \"prompt for ratings\" or \"ask for reviews\"\n- Asks about \"StoreKit review\" or \"SKStoreReviewController\"\n\n## Platform Detection (CRITICAL)\n\n**This skill only applies to App Store distributed apps.**\n\n### iOS Apps\n- Always applicable (iOS apps require App Store)\n\n### macOS Apps\nDetection steps:\n1. Check for `com.apple.application-identifier` entitlement\n2. Look for Mac App Store related code\n3. If unclear, **ASK THE USER**:\n   - \"Is this app distributed via Mac App Store or direct download?\"\n\n### If NOT App Store:\n- Explain that StoreKit reviews only work for App Store apps\n- Offer alternative: In-app feedback form\n- Skip generation or generate feedback form instead\n\n## Pre-Generation Checks\n\n### 1. Project Context Detection\n- [ ] Determine platform (iOS/macOS)\n- [ ] Check distribution method (App Store vs direct)\n- [ ] Search for existing review prompt code\n- [ ] Identify App entry point\n\n### 2. Conflict Detection\nSearch for existing implementations:\n```\nGrep: \"requestReview\" or \"SKStoreReviewController\" or \"StoreKit\"\nGlob: **/*Review*.swift\n```\n\nIf found, ask user:\n- Replace existing implementation?\n- Enhance with better timing logic?\n\n## Configuration Questions\n\nAsk user via AskUserQuestion:\n\n1. **Trigger conditions?** (multi-select)\n   - Session count (e.g., after 5 sessions)\n   - Days since install (e.g., after 3 days)\n   - Positive actions (e.g., after completing a task)\n   - Feature usage (e.g., after using key feature 3 times)\n\n2. **Minimum thresholds?**\n   - Sessions before first prompt: 3-5 (default: 3)\n   - Days before first prompt: 2-7 (default: 3)\n\n3. **Cool-down period?**\n   - Days between prompts: 30-90 (default: 60)\n   - Apple limits to 3 prompts/year anyway\n\n4. **Debug mode?**\n   - Include debug override for testing?\n\n## Generation Process\n\n### Step 1: Create Core Files\n\nGenerate these files:\n1. `ReviewPromptManager.swift` - Core logic and timing\n2. `ReviewPromptCondition.swift` - Configurable conditions\n3. `ReviewPromptStorage.swift` - Persistence for tracking\n\n### Step 2: Determine File Location\n\nCheck project structure:\n- If `Sources/` exists → `Sources/Reviews/`\n- If `App/` exists → `App/Reviews/`\n- Otherwise → `Reviews/`\n\n### Step 3: Add Platform Guards\n\nFor macOS, include:\n```swift\n#if os(macOS)\n// Check if running from App Store\nguard Bundle.main.appStoreReceiptURL?.lastPathComponent != \"sandboxReceipt\" else {\n    // Running in sandbox but not App Store - skip\n    return\n}\n#endif\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\nAfter generation, provide:\n\n### Files Created\n```\nSources/Reviews/\n├── ReviewPromptManager.swift      # Core logic\n├── ReviewPromptCondition.swift    # Conditions enum\n└── ReviewPromptStorage.swift      # UserDefaults persistence\n```\n\n### Integration Steps\n\n**Option 1: Automatic (Recommended)**\n```swift\n@main\nstruct MyApp: App {\n    var body: some Scene {\n        WindowGroup {\n            ContentView()\n                .onAppear {\n                    ReviewPromptManager.shared.incrementSession()\n                }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// In relevant places (after positive actions):\nReviewPromptManager.shared.recordPositiveAction()\nReviewPromptManager.shared.requestReviewIfAppropriate()\n```\n\n**Option 2: Manual Trigger Points**\n```swift\n// After user completes a significant action\nfunc completeTask() {\n    // ... task completion logic ...\n\n    ReviewPromptManager.shared.recordPositiveAction()\n    ReviewPromptManager.shared.requestReviewIfAppropriate()\n}\n```\n\n### Apple''s Guidelines\n- System limits to 3 prompts per 365-day period\n- Prompt appears at system''s discretion (not guaranteed)\n- Never prompt after negative experience\n- Don''t prompt on first launch\n- Don''t interrupt user''s workflow\n\n### Testing Instructions\n\n1. **Debug Mode**: Set `ReviewPromptManager.debugAlwaysShow = true`\n2. **Reset State**: Call `ReviewPromptStorage.reset()`\n3. **Simulate**: Increment sessions/actions in debug builds\n4. **Note**: Actual prompt may not show in Simulator\n\n### App Store Review URL (Alternative)\nFor custom UI or macOS direct distribution:\n```swift\n// Deep link to App Store review page\nlet appID = \"YOUR_APP_ID\"\nlet url = URL(string: \"https://apps.apple.com/app/id\\(appID)?action=write-review\")!\nNSWorkspace.shared.open(url)  // macOS\nUIApplication.shared.open(url)  // iOS\n```\n\n## References\n\n- **storekit-patterns.md** - Best practices and timing strategies\n- **templates/** - All template files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:06:54.366Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Development Agents needing advanced review prompting capabilities with configurable trigger conditions and platform detection","zh":"适用于需要高级评论提示功能的移动应用开发代理，具有可配置的触发条件和平台检测","ja":"高度なレビュー提示機能と可構成のトリガー条件、プラットフォーム検出が必要なモバイルアプリ開発エージェントに適しています","ko":"고급 리뷰提示 기능과 구성 가능한 트리거 조건 및 플랫폼 감지가 필요한 모바일 앱 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo de Aplicaciones Móviles que necesitan capacidades de solicitud de revisión avanzadas con condiciones de activación configurables y detección de plataforma","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développement d''Applications Mobiles ayant besoin de fonctionnalités de demande de révision avancées avec des conditions de déclenchement configurables et de détection de plateforme","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App-Entwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Überprüfungsanforderungsfunktionen mit konfigurierbaren Triggerbedingungen und Plattformerkennung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Aplicativos Móveis que precisam de capacidades avançadas de prompting de revisão com condições de disparo configuráveis e detecção de plataforma","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки мобильных приложений, которым требуются расширенные возможности запроса обзора с настраиваемыми условиями триггера и обнаружением платформы","ar":"مثالي لموظفي تطوير التطبيقات النقالة الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لطلب المراجعة مع شروط التنشيط القابلة للتهيئة والكشف عن المنصة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate smart App Store review prompts using StoreKit review and SKStoreReviewController, with proper timing logic and platform detection, enabling seamless integration with App Store rating systems","zh":"赋予代理生成智能应用商店评论提示的能力，利用StoreKit评论和SKStoreReviewController，具有适当的时序逻辑和平台检测，实现与应用商店评级系统的无缝集成","ja":"エージェントに、StoreKitレビューとSKStoreReviewControllerを使用して、スマートなアプリストアレビュープロンプトを生成する能力を与え、適切なタイミングロジックとプラットフォーム検出を実現し、アプリストア評価システムとのシームレスな統合を可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 StoreKit 리뷰와 SKStoreReviewController를 사용하여 스마트한 앱스토어 리뷰 프롬프트를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 적절한 타이밍 로직과 플랫폼 감지를 구현하여 앱스토어 평가 시스템과의 無縫な統合을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar solicitudes de revisión inteligentes de la App Store utilizando StoreKit review y SKStoreReviewController, con lógica de temporización adecuada y detección de plataforma, lo que permite una integración fluida con los sistemas de calificación de la App Store","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des demandes de révision intelligentes de l''App Store en utilisant StoreKit review et SKStoreReviewController, avec une logique de temporisation appropriée et de détection de plateforme, permettant ainsi une intégration fluide avec les systèmes de notation de l''App Store","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, intelligente App-Store-Rezensionsanfragen zu generieren, die StoreKit-Rezension und SKStoreReviewController verwenden, mit geeigneter Zeitlogik und Plattformerkennung, was eine nahtlose Integration mit den App-Store-Bewertungssystemen ermöglicht","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar prompts de revisão inteligentes da App Store usando StoreKit review e SKStoreReviewController, com lógica de temporização adequada e detecção de plataforma, permitindo uma integração perfeita com os sistemas de classificação da App Store","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать умные запросы обзора App Store с помощью StoreKit review и SKStoreReviewController, с правильной логикой тайминга и обнаружением платформы, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с системами рейтинга App Store","ar":"تمكّن الموظفين من توليد مطالبات مراجعة ذكية لمتجر التطبيقات باستخدام StoreKit review و SKStoreReviewController، مع منطق توقيت مناسب والكشف عن المنصة، مما يتيح التكامل السلس مع أنظمة تصنيف متجر التطبيقات"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating review prompts based on user interactions","Generating review requests with configurable trigger conditions","Optimizing App Store review prompts for maximum user engagement"],"zh":["基于用户交互自动化评论提示","生成具有可配置触发条件的评论请求","优化应用商店评论提示以实现最大用户参与度"],"ja":["ユーザーインタラクションに基づくレビュープロンプトの自動化","可構成のトリガー条件を持つレビュー要求の生成","アプリストアレビュープロンプトの最適化による最大ユーザーエンゲージメントの実現"],"ko":["사용자 상호작용 기반 리뷰 프롬프트 자동화","구성 가능한 트리거 조건을 갖는 리뷰 요청 생성","앱스토어 리뷰 프롬프트 최적화를 통한 최대 사용자 참여도 달성"],"es":["Automatizar las solicitudes de revisión en función de las interacciones del usuario","Generar solicitudes de revisión con condiciones de activación configurables","Optimizar las solicitudes de revisión de la App Store para el máximo compromiso del usuario"],"fr":["Automatiser les demandes de révision en fonction des interactions de l''utilisateur","Générer des demandes de révision avec des conditions de déclenchement configurables","Optimiser les demandes de révision de l''App Store pour un engagement maximum de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Automatisieren von Überprüfungsanforderungen basierend auf Benutzerinteraktionen","Generieren von Überprüfungsanfragen mit konfigurierbaren Triggerbedingungen","Optimieren von App-Store-Rezensionsanfragen für maximale Benutzerbeteiligung"],"pt":["Automatizar prompts de revisão com base em interações do usuário","Gerar solicitações de revisão com condições de disparo configuráveis","Otimizar prompts de revisão da App Store para o máximo de engajamento do usuário"],"ru":["Автоматизация запросов обзора на