von src/ für die Organisation des Codes"],"pt":["Mapeamento de módulos para navegação eficiente","Definições de CLI para configuração fácil","Arquitetura escalável para projetos de grande escala","Integração com tecnologias de ponta, como Rust e Clap","Suporte a múltiplos módulos e funcionalidades"],"ru":["Карта модулей для эффективной навигации","Определения CLI для простой конфигурации","Масштабируемая архитектура для крупных проектов","Интеграция с передовыми технологиями, такими как Rust и Clap","Поддержка нескольких модулей и функций"],"ar":["خريطة الوحدات للتنقل الفعال","تعريفات CLI للضبط السهل","بنية قابلة للتوسيع لمشاريع كبيرة","التكامل مع التقنيات الحديثة، مثل Rust وClap","دعم متعددة الوحدات والوظائف"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use lidx-architecture","lidx-architecture setup guide","lidx-architecture alternative","lidx-architecture vs module mapping","lidx-architecture install","what is lidx-architecture"],"zh":["lidx-architecture","模块导航","CLI集成","开发工具","AI开发","模块边界理解","功能定位","架构变更规划"],"ja":["lidx-architecture","モジュールマップ","AIエージェント","開発ツール","AI開発","モジュールの境界理解","機能の位置付け","アーキテクチャの変更計画"],"ko":["lidx-architecture","모듈 네비게이션","CLI 통합","개발 도구","AI 개발","모듈 경계 이해","기능 위치","아키텍처 변경 계획"],"es":["arquitectura lidx","desarrollo de aplicaciones escalables","clap","Rust","diseño de módulos","definición de argumentos de línea de comandos","programación en Rust","aplicaciones mantenibles"],"fr":["architecture lidx","développement d''applications évolutives","clap","Rust","conception de modules","définition des arguments de ligne de commande","programmation en Rust","applications maintenables"],"de":["lidx-Architektur","Entwicklung von skalierbaren Anwendungen","clap","Rust","Modul-Design","Definition von Kommandozeilenargumenten","Programmierung in Rust","wartbare Anwendungen"],"pt":["arquitetura lidx","navegação de módulos","definições de CLI","desenvolvimento de software","Rust","Clap","configuração de projeto","gerenciamento de módulos"],"ru":["архитектура lidx","навигация по модулям","определения CLI","разработка программного обеспечения","Rust","Clap","конфигурация проекта","управление модулями"],"ar":["بنية ليدكس","تنقل الوحدات","تعريفات CLI","تطوير البرمجيات","Rust","Clap","ضبط المشروع","إدارة الوحدات"]}},"owner":"JacobSoderblom","repo":"lidx","repoPath":"JacobSoderblom/lidx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"lidx-architecture","description":"Navigate lidxs architecture and codebase. Use when designing features, understanding module boundaries, or finding where things live.","bodyPreview":"# lidx Architecture Navigation\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing a new feature that spans multiple modules\n- Understanding module boundaries before making changes\n- Finding where a specific piece of functionality lives\n- Planning architectural changes\n\n---\n\n## Module Map\n\n```\nsrc/\n  main.rs            -- Entry point, clap dispatch to serve/reindex/mcp-serve\n  cli.rs             -- CLI arg definitions (clap Parser/Subcommand)\n  lib.rs             -- Module declarations\n  config.rs","body":"# lidx Architecture Navigation\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing a new feature that spans multiple modules\n- Understanding module boundaries before making changes\n- Finding where a specific piece of functionality lives\n- Planning architectural changes\n\n---\n\n## Module Map\n\n```\nsrc/\n  main.rs            -- Entry point, clap dispatch to serve/reindex/mcp-serve\n  cli.rs             -- CLI arg definitions (clap Parser/Subcommand)\n  lib.rs             -- Module declarations\n  config.rs          -- Runtime config, env var overrides (LIDX_*)\n  model.rs           -- All response/output types (Symbol, Edge, etc.)\n\n  rpc.rs             -- JSONL RPC dispatch: handle_method() with ~30 methods\n  mcp.rs             -- MCP stdio server: wraps rpc as single \"lidx\" tool\n\n  db/\n    mod.rs           -- Db struct, r2d2 pool, all SQL queries as methods\n    migrations.rs    -- Schema DDL, version-gated ALTER TABLE migrations\n\n  indexer/\n    mod.rs           -- Indexer struct, orchestrates scanning + extraction + DB writes\n    scan.rs          -- File discovery (ignore crate), extension-to-language mapping\n    batch.rs         -- Batched DB writes for symbols/edges\n    extract.rs       -- SymbolInput, EdgeInput, ExtractedFile types\n    differ.rs        -- Symbol diff detection between versions\n    stable_id.rs     -- Content-hash-based stable symbol identifiers\n    python.rs        -- Python tree-sitter extractor\n    rust.rs          -- Rust tree-sitter extractor\n    javascript.rs    -- JS/TS/TSX tree-sitter extractors\n    csharp.rs        -- C# tree-sitter extractor\n    sql.rs           -- SQL tree-sitter extractor\n    markdown.rs      -- Markdown heading extractor\n    proto.rs         -- Protobuf service/method extractor + RPC edge detection\n    xref.rs          -- Cross-language reference detection (C#->SQL, C#->Python)\n    channel.rs       -- CHANNEL_PUBLISH/SUBSCRIBE detection (message bus)\n    http.rs          -- HTTP_CALL/HTTP_ROUTE detection\n    test_detection.rs -- Identifies test files and test functions\n\n  impact/\n    mod.rs           -- Impact analysis module root\n    orchestrator.rs  -- Multi-layer impact orchestration\n    layers/          -- Impact layers (direct, test, historical)\n    types.rs         -- Impact-specific types\n    confidence.rs    -- Confidence scoring for impact edges\n    config.rs        -- Impact analysis configuration\n\n  search.rs          -- Text search: ripgrep subprocess + result parsing\n  subgraph.rs        -- Multi-root BFS expansion over the symbol graph\n  gather_context.rs  -- Budget-aware context assembly (byte/node/depth limits)\n  watch.rs           -- File watching (notify crate), debounce, fallback polling\n  git_mining.rs      -- Git log mining for co-change history\n  metrics.rs         -- File and symbol metrics (LOC, complexity, duplication)\n  diagnostics.rs     -- Diagnostic ingestion (SARIF, inline)\n  repo_map.rs        -- Repository map generation\n  util.rs            -- Shared utilities\n```\n\n---\n\n## Data Flow\n\n**Indexing**: filesystem -> `scan.rs` (discover files) -> language extractor (tree-sitter AST -> SymbolInput/EdgeInput) -> post-passes (xref, channel, http) -> `batch.rs` (bulk insert) -> SQLite\n\n**Querying**: stdin -> `mcp.rs`/`rpc.rs` (parse request) -> `handle_method()` (dispatch) -> `Db` methods (SQL queries) -> response JSON with `next_hops` -> stdout\n\n**Watch loop**: `notify` events -> debounce -> batch of changed paths -> `Indexer::sync_paths()` -> re-extract + diff + update DB\n\n---\n\n## Key Types\n\n- `Symbol` / `SymbolCompact` -- full and abbreviated symbol representations\n- `Edge` -- graph edge with kind, source/target, evidence, confidence\n- `ExtractedFile` -- output of a language extractor (symbols + edges + metrics)\n- `Indexer` -- owns all extractors, DB handle, scan options\n- `Db` -- SQLite pool + write mutex, all query methods\n\n---\n\n## Finding Things\n\n- **RPC method implementation**: search for `\"method_name\" =>` in `src/rpc.rs`\n- **DB query**: search for the method name in `src/db/mod.rs`\n- **Edge kind usage**: grep for the kind string (e.g., `\"CHANNEL_PUBLISH\"`)\n- **Response types**: `src/model.rs`\n- **Language-specific extraction**: `src/indexer/{language}.rs`\n- **Tests**: `tests/{feature}.rs`, fixtures in `tests/fixtures/`\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**RPC dispatch**: `src/rpc.rs` -> `handle_method()`\n**DB queries**: `src/db/mod.rs`\n**Migrations**: `src/db/migrations.rs`\n**Language extractors**: `src/indexer/{lang}.rs`\n**Response types**: `src/model.rs`\n**Tests**: `tests/`, fixtures in `tests/fixtures/`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:09.936Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Modular System Agents needing comprehensive module boundary navigation and architectural planning.","zh":"非常适合需要全面模块边界导航和架构规划的模块系统代理。","ja":"モジュールシステムエージェントが包括的なモジュール境界ナビゲーションとアーキテクチャ計画を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"포괄적인 모듈 경계 탐색 및 아키텍처 계획이 필요한 모듈 시스템 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Sistemas Modulares que necesitan una navegación integral de límites de módulos y planificación arquitectónica.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Systèmes Modulaires ayant besoin d''une navigation complète des limites de modules et de planification architecturale.","de":"Perfekt für modulare Systemagenten, die eine umfassende Navigation von Modulgrenzen und architektonische Planung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Sistema Modulares que necessitam de navegação abrangente de limites de módulos e planejamento arquitetônico.","ru":"Идеально подходит для модульных агентов системы, требующих всесторонней навигации по границам модулей и архитектурного планирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل النظام المكون من وحدات فرعية يحتاج إلى التنقل الشامل لحدود الوحدة الفرعية والتخطيط المعماري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design new features spanning multiple modules, understand module boundaries, and plan architectural changes using module maps and clap dispatch mechanisms.","zh":"赋予代理设计跨多个模块的新功能、理解模块边界和使用模块地图和clap调度机制规划架构更改的能力。","ja":"複数のモジュールにわたる新機能を設計し、モジュール境界を理解し、モジュールマップとclap.dispatchメカニズムを使用してアーキテクチャの変更を計画する能力をエージェントに与えます。","ko":"다중 모듈에 걸친 새로운 기능을 설계하고 모듈 경계를 이해하며 모듈 맵과 clap.dispatch 메커니즘을 사용하여 아키텍처 변경을 계획할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para diseñar nuevas características que abarcan múltiples módulos, comprender los límites de los módulos y planificar cambios arquitectónicos utilizando mapas de módulos y mecanismos de despacho de clap.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir de nouvelles fonctionnalités s''étendant sur plusieurs modules, de comprendre les limites des modules et de planifier des modifications architecturales en utilisant des cartes de modules et des mécanismes de dispatch de clap.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue Funktionen zu entwerfen, die mehrere Module umfassen, Modulgrenzen zu verstehen und architektonische Änderungen mithilfe von Modulkarten und Clap-Dispatch-Mechanismen zu planen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar novos recursos que abrangem vários módulos, entender limites de módulos e planejar mudanças arquitetônicas usando mapas de módulos e mecanismos de dispatch de clap.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать новые функции, охватывающие несколько модулей, понимать границы модулей и планировать архитектурные изменения с использованием карт модулей и механизмов диспетчеризации clap.","ar":"يتمكن العميل من تصميم ميزات جديدة تشمل وحدات فرعية متعددة، وفهم حدود الوحدة الفرعية، وتخطيط التغييرات المعمارية باستخدام خرائط الوحدة الفرعية وآليات clap للتحويل."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new features across multiple modules","Understanding module boundaries before making changes","Planning architectural changes with module maps","Navigating src directory structures for efficient development"],"zh":["跨多个模块设计新的功能","在进行更改之前了解模块边界","使用模块地图规划架构更改","导航src目录结构以实现高效开发"],"ja":["複数のモジュールにわたる新機能を設計する","変更を加える前にモジュール境界を理解する","モジュールマップを使用してアーキテクチャの変更を計画する","効率的な開発のためのsrcディレクトリ構造のナビゲーション"],"ko":["다중 모듈에 걸친 새로운 기능을 설계함","변경을 진행하기 전에 모듈 경계를 이해함","모듈 맵을 사용하여 아키텍처 변경을 계획함","효율적인 개발을 위한 src 디렉토리 구조 탐색"],"es":["Diseñar nuevas características en varios módulos","Comprender los límites de los módulos antes de realizar cambios","Planificar cambios arquitectónicos con mapas de módulos","Navegar por estructuras de directorios src para un desarrollo eficiente"],"fr":["Concevoir de nouvelles fonctionnalités à travers plusieurs modules","Comprendre les limites des modules avant d''apporter des modifications","Planifier des modifications architecturales avec des cartes de modules","Naviguer dans les structures de répertoires src pour un développement efficace"],"de":["Neue Funktionen über mehrere Module hinweg entwerfen","Modulgrenzen vor Änderungen verstehen","Architektonische Änderungen mit Modulkarten planen","Effizient durch src-Verzeichnisstrukturen navigieren"],"pt":["Projetar novos recursos em várias unidades fracionárias","Entender limites de unidades fracionárias antes de fazer alterações","Planejar mudanças arquitetônicas com mapas de unidades fracionárias","Navegar estruturas de diretórios src para desenvolvimento eficiente"],"ru":["Проектирование новых функций в нескольких модулях","Понимание границ модулей перед внесением изменений","Планирование архитектурных изменений с помощью карт модулей","Навигация по структурам каталогов src для эффективного развития"],"ar":["تصميم ميزات جديدة عبر وحدات فرعية متعددة","فهم حدود الوحدة الفرعية قبل إحداث التغييرات","تخطيط التغييرات المعمارية باستخدام خرائط الوحدة الفرعية","التنقل في هيكل المجلدات src من أجل التطوير الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Rust and clap library","Specific to lidx-architecture and its module structure"],"zh":["需要Rust和clap库的知识","特定于lidx-architecture及其模块结构"],"ja":["Rustとclapライブラリの知識が必要","lidx-architecture及其モジュール構造に特有"],"ko":["Rust와 clap 라이브러리의 지식이 필요함","lidx-architecture及其 모듈 구조에 특정함"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Rust y biblioteca clap","Específico de lidx-architecture y su estructura de módulos"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de Rust et de la bibliothèque clap","Spécifique à lidx-architecture et à sa structure de modules"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Rust und der clap-Bibliothek","Spezifisch für lidx-architecture und deren Modulstruktur"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Rust e biblioteca clap","Específico para lidx-architecture e sua estrutura de módulos"],"ru":["Требует знания Rust и библиотеки clap","Специфичен для lidx-architecture и ее структуры модулей"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة باللغة روست ومكتبة clap","محدد لمعمارية lidx-architecture وهيكل الوحدات الفرعية الخاصة بها"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e080ae2276434d3523c1d65167100990d338c65c4b86197450db93b97a98326c","qualityScore":60}');
