","Intégration avec dex pour le suivi des tâches","Utilisation de commandes comme `dex <command>` ou `npx @zeeg/dex <command>`"],"de":["Umwandlung von Markdown-Dokumenten in nachverfolgbare Aufgaben","Verwendung der dex-Kommandozeile zum Umwandeln von Dokumenten","Kompatibilität mit der Markdown-Syntax","Integration mit dex für die Nachverfolgung von Aufgaben","Verwendung von Befehlen wie `dex <command>` oder `npx @zeeg/dex <command>`"],"pt":["Conversão de documentos Markdown em tarefas trackeáveis","Uso do comando `dex` para integração","Compatibilidade com documentos Markdown","Suporte à linha de comando","Integração com workflows de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Конвертация документов Markdown в отслеживаемые задачи","Использование команды `dex` для интеграции","Совместимость с документами Markdown","Поддержка командной строки","Интеграция с процессами разработки"],"ar":["تحويل مستندات Markdown إلى مهام قابلة للتعقب","استخدام الأمر `dex` للدمج","التوافق مع مستندات Markdown","دعم سطر الأوامر","التكامل مع تدفقات العمل"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use dex-plan","dex-plan setup guide","markdown to task conversion","dex-plan alternative","dex-plan vs task management tools","installing dex-plan","what is dex-plan","dex-plan command line tool","converting markdown to tasks"],"zh":["dex-plan","Markdown 文档转换","可追踪的任务","dex 命令行工具","AI 工具","计划文档转换"],"ja":["dex-plan","Markdown ドキュメント変換","トラック可能なタスク","dex コマンドライン ツール","AI エージェント","プランニング ドキュメント変換"],"ko":["dex-plan","마크다운 문서 변환","추적 가능한 태스크","dex 명령줄 도구","AI 도구","계획 문서 변환"],"es":["dex-plan","herramientas de línea de comandos","conversión de documentos de Markdown","seguimiento de tareas","dex","npx @zeeg/dex","Agente de IA","Herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["dex-plan","outils de ligne de commande","conversion de documents Markdown","suivi des tâches","dex","npx @zeeg/dex","Agent d''IA","Outils de développement"],"de":["dex-plan","Kommandozeilen-Tools","Umwandlung von Markdown-Dokumenten","Nachverfolgung von Aufgaben","dex","npx @zeeg/dex","KI-Agent","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["dex-plan","conversão de documentos Markdown","tarefas trackeáveis","ferramenta de linha de comando","desenvolvimento de software","workflow de desenvolvimento","integração com dex"],"ru":["dex-plan","конвертация документов Markdown","отслеживаемые задачи","командная строка инструмент","разработка программного обеспечения","процесс разработки","интеграция с dex"],"ar":["dex-plan","تحويل مستندات Markdown","مهام قابلة للتعقب","أداة سطر أوامر","تطوير البرمجيات","تدفق العمل","التكامل مع dex"]}},"owner":"sanjitsaluja","repo":"zugzwang-puzzle-trainer","repoPath":"sanjitsaluja/zugzwang-puzzle-trainer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.421Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dex-plan","description":"Create dex task from markdown planning documents (plans, specs, design docs, roadmaps)","bodyPreview":"# Converting Markdown Documents to Tasks\n\n## Command Invocation\n\nUse `dex` directly for all commands:\n\n```bash\ndex <command>\n```\n\nIf `dex` is not on PATH, use `npx @zeeg/dex <command>` instead. Check once at the start:\n\n```bash\ncommand -v dex &>/dev/null && echo \"use: dex\" || echo \"use: npx @zeeg/dex\"\n```\n\nUse `/dex-plan` to convert any markdown planning document into a trackable dex task.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- After completing a plan in plan mode\n- Converting specification documents to trackable t","body":"# Converting Markdown Documents to Tasks\n\n## Command Invocation\n\nUse `dex` directly for all commands:\n\n```bash\ndex <command>\n```\n\nIf `dex` is not on PATH, use `npx @zeeg/dex <command>` instead. Check once at the start:\n\n```bash\ncommand -v dex &>/dev/null && echo \"use: dex\" || echo \"use: npx @zeeg/dex\"\n```\n\nUse `/dex-plan` to convert any markdown planning document into a trackable dex task.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- After completing a plan in plan mode\n- Converting specification documents to trackable tasks\n- Converting design documents to implementation tasks\n- Creating tasks from roadmap or milestone documents\n- Tracking any markdown planning or design content\n\n## Supported Documents\n\nAny markdown file containing planning or design content:\n\n- Plan files from plan mode (`~/.claude/plans/*.md`)\n- Specification documents (`SPEC.md`, `REQUIREMENTS.md`)\n- Design documents (`DESIGN.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`)\n- Roadmaps and milestone documents (`ROADMAP.md`)\n- Feature proposals and technical RFCs\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/dex-plan <markdown-file-path>\n```\n\n### Examples\n\n**From plan mode:**\n\n```bash\n/dex-plan /home/user/.claude/plans/moonlit-brewing-lynx.md\n```\n\n**From specification document:**\n\n```bash\n/dex-plan @SPEC.md\n```\n\n**From design document:**\n\n```bash\n/dex-plan docs/AUTHENTICATION_DESIGN.md\n```\n\n**From roadmap:**\n\n```bash\n/dex-plan ROADMAP.md\n```\n\n## What It Does\n\n1. Reads the markdown file\n2. Extracts title from first `#` heading (or uses filename as fallback)\n3. Strips \"Plan: \" prefix if present (case-insensitive)\n4. Creates dex task with full markdown content as context\n5. Analyzes plan structure for potential subtask breakdown\n6. Automatically creates subtasks when appropriate\n7. Returns task ID and breakdown summary\n\n## Examples\n\n**From plan mode file:**\n\n```markdown\n# Plan: Add JWT Authentication\n\n## Summary\n\n...\n```\n\n→ Task description: \"Add JWT Authentication\" (note: \"Plan: \" prefix stripped)\n\n**From specification document:**\n\n```markdown\n# User Authentication Specification\n\n## Requirements\n\n...\n```\n\n→ Task description: \"User Authentication Specification\"\n\n## Automatic Subtask Breakdown\n\nAfter creating the main task, the skill analyzes the plan structure to determine if breaking it into subtasks adds value.\n\n### Hierarchy Levels\n\nThe skill supports up to 3 levels (maximum depth enforced by dex):\n\n| Level | Name        | Example                           |\n| ----- | ----------- | --------------------------------- |\n| L0    | **Epic**    | \"Add user authentication system\"  |\n| L1    | **Task**    | \"Implement JWT middleware\"        |\n| L2    | **Subtask** | \"Add token verification function\" |\n\n### When Breakdown Happens\n\nThe skill creates subtasks when the plan has:\n\n- 3-7 clearly separable work items (numbered steps, distinct sections, implementation phases)\n- Implementation across multiple files or components (different modules, layers, or areas)\n- Clear sequential dependencies (step 1 before step 2)\n- Independent items that benefit from separate tracking\n\n**Epic-level breakdown** (creates tasks, not subtasks) when:\n\n- Plan has major phases/sections with their own sub-items\n- 5+ distinct areas of work\n- Plan spans multiple systems or components\n- Work will require multiple sessions\n\n### When Breakdown Does NOT Happen\n\nThe skill keeps a single task when:\n\n- Plan describes one cohesive task (even if detailed with multiple paragraphs)\n- Only 1-2 steps present (not enough to warrant breakdown)\n- Work items are tightly coupled (can''t be separated meaningfully)\n- Plan is exploratory or investigative (research, analysis, discovery)\n- Breaking down would create artificial boundaries that don''t reflect natural work units\n\n### What Each Subtask Contains\n\nWhen breakdown occurs, each subtask includes:\n\n- Description: Brief summary extracted from list item, heading, or section\n- Context: Relevant details from that section plus reference to parent task\n- Parent link: Automatically linked to main task via `--parent`\n\n### Example: With Breakdown\n\n**Input plan** (`auth-plan.md`):\n\n```markdown\n# Plan: Add Authentication System\n\n## Implementation\n\n1. Create database schema for users/tokens\n2. Implement auth controller with endpoints\n3. Add JWT middleware for route protection\n4. Build frontend login/register forms\n5. Add integration tests\n```\n\n**Output**:\n\n```\nCreated task abc123 from plan\n\nAnalyzed plan structure: Found 5 distinct implementation steps\nCreated 5 subtasks:\n- abc124: Create database schema for users/tokens\n- abc125: Implement auth controller with endpoints\n- abc126: Add JWT middleware for route protection\n- abc127: Build frontend login/register forms\n- abc128: Add integration tests\n\nView full structure: dex show abc123\n```\n\n### Example: Without Breakdown\n\n**Input plan** (`bugfix-plan.md`):\n\n```markdown\n# Plan: Fix Login Validation Bug\n\n## Problem\n\nLogin fails when username has spaces\n\n## Solution\n\nUpdate validation regex in auth.ts line 42 to allow spaces\n```\n\n**Output**:\n\n```\nCreated task xyz789 from plan\n\nPlan describes a cohesive single task. No subtask breakdown needed.\n\nView task: dex show xyz789\n```\n\n### Example: Epic-Level Breakdown (Two-Level Hierarchy)\n\n**Input plan** (`full-auth-plan.md`):\n\n```markdown\n# Plan: Complete User Authentication System\n\n## Phase 1: Backend Infrastructure\n\n1. Create database schema for users and sessions\n2. Implement password hashing with bcrypt\n3. Add JWT token generation and validation\n\n## Phase 2: API Endpoints\n\n1. POST /auth/register - User registration\n2. POST /auth/login - User login\n3. POST /auth/logout - Session invalidation\n4. POST /auth/reset-password - Password reset flow\n\n## Phase 3: Frontend Integration\n\n1. Login/register forms with validation\n2. Protected route components\n3. Session persistence with refresh tokens\n```\n\n**Output**:\n\n```\nCreated epic abc123 from plan\n\nAnalyzed plan structure: Found 3 major phases with sub-items\nCreated as epic with 3 tasks:\n- def456: Backend Infrastructure (3 subtasks)\n- ghi789: API Endpoints (4 subtasks)\n- jkl012: Frontend Integration (3 subtasks)\n\nView full structure: dex list abc123\n```\n\n## Options\n\n```bash\n/dex-plan <file> --priority 2              # Set priority\n/dex-plan <file> --parent abc123           # Create as subtask\n```\n\n## After Creating\n\nOnce created, you can:\n\n- View the task: `dex show <task-id>`\n- Create additional subtasks: `dex create \"...\" --parent <task-id> --description \"...\"`\n- Track progress through implementation\n- Complete the task: `dex complete <task-id> --result \"...\"`\n\nRun `dex show <task-id>` to see the full task structure including any automatically created subtasks.\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n- Document is incomplete or exploratory (just draft notes)\n- Content isn''t actionable or ready for implementation\n- File hasn''t been saved to disk yet\n- File doesn''t contain meaningful planning/design content\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Instructions for Skill\n\n**These instructions are for the skill agent executing `/dex-plan`.** Follow this workflow exactly:\n\n### Step 1: Create Main Task\n\nExecute the `dex plan` command with the provided markdown file:\n\n```bash\ndex plan <markdown-file> [options]\n```\n\nThis creates the parent task and returns its ID. Capture this ID for subsequent steps.\n\n### Step 2: Read and Analyze the Plan\n\nAfter creating the main task, read it back to analyze its structure:\n\n```bash\ndex show <task-id>\n```\n\nExamine the context field (which contains the full markdown) for breakdown potential.\n\n### Step 3: Apply Breakdown Decision Logic\n\n**Analyze the plan structure and decide**: Should this be broken down into subtasks?\n\n#### Look for these breakdown indicators:\n\n1. Numbered or bulleted implementation lists (3-7 items):\n\n   ```markdown\n   ## Implementation\n\n   1. Create database schema → SUBTASK\n   2. Build API endpoints → SUBTASK\n   3. Add frontend components → SUBTASK\n   ```\n\n2. Clear subsections under implementation/tasks/steps:\n\n   ```markdown\n   ### 1. Backend Changes\n\n   - Modify server.ts\n   - Add authentication\n     → SUBTASK: \"Backend Changes\" with this context\n\n   ### 2. Frontend Updates\n\n   - Update login form\n   - Add error handling\n     → SUBTASK: \"Frontend Updates\" with this context\n   ```\n\n3. File-specific sections:\n\n   ```markdown\n   ### `src/auth.ts` - Add JWT validation\n\n   [Details about changes]\n   → SUBTASK: \"Add JWT validation to auth.ts\"\n\n   ### `src/middleware.ts` - Create auth middleware\n\n   [Details about changes]\n   → SUBTASK: \"Create auth middleware\"\n   ```\n\n4. Sequential phases:\n\n   ```markdown\n   ## Implementation Sequence\n\n   **Phase 1: Database Layer**\n   [Details] → SUBTASK\n\n   **Phase 2: API Layer**\n   [Details] → SUBTASK\n\n   **Phase 3: Frontend Layer**\n   [Details] → SUBTASK\n   ```\n\n#### Do NOT break down when:\n\n- Only 1-2 steps/items present\n- Plan is a single cohesive fix or small change\n- Content is exploratory (\"investigate\", \"research\", \"explore\")\n- Work items are inseparable (tightly coupled implementation)\n- Breaking down creates artificial boundaries\n- Plan is very short (< 10 lines of meaningful content)\n\n### Step 4: Extract Subtasks (If Breaking Down)\n\nFor each identified subtask:\n\n1. Extract description: Use the list item text, heading, or section title\n   - Strip numbering and bullets: \"1. Add auth\" → \"Add auth\"\n   - Keep it concise (1-10 words)\n   - Use imperative form: \"Add\", \"Create\", \"Update\", \"Fix\"\n\n2. Extract context: Include relevant details from that section\n   - Copy the full section content for that subtask\n   - Add reference: \"This is part of [parent task description]\"\n   - Include code snippets, file paths, specific requirements\n\n3. Create the subtask:\n   ```bash\n   dex create \"<subtask-description>\" \\\n     --parent <parent-task-id> \\\n     --description \"<extracted-context-with-parent-reference>\"\n   ```\n\n### Step 5: Report Results\n\nIf subtasks were created:\n\n```\nCreated task <id> from plan\n\nAnalyzed plan structure: Found <N> distinct implementation steps\nCreated <N> subtasks:\n- <subtask-id-1>: <description-1>\n- <subtask-id-2>: <description-2>\n- <subtask-id-3>: <description-3>\n...\n\nView full structure: dex show <parent-id>\n```\n\nIf no breakdown occurred:\n\n```\nCreated task <id> from plan\n\nPlan describes a cohesive single task. No subtask breakdown needed.\n\nView task: dex show <id>\n```\n\n### Examples of Subtask Extraction\n\nExample 1: Numbered list\n\n```markdown\n## Implementation Steps\n\n1. Create User model with email, password fields\n2. Add POST /api/auth/register endpoint\n3. Implement JWT token generation\n```\n\nExtracted subtasks:\n\n```bash\ndex create \"Create User model with email, password fields\" \\\n  --parent abc123 \\\n  --description \"Create a User model with email and password fields. This is part of ''Add Authentication System''.\"\n\ndex create \"Add POST /api/auth/register endpoint\" \\\n  --parent abc123 \\\n  --description \"Add POST /api/auth/register endpoint to handle user registration. This is part of ''Add Authentication System''.\"\n\ndex create \"Implement JWT token generation\" \\\n  --parent abc123 \\\n  --description \"Implement JWT token generation for authenticated sessions. This is part of ''Add Authentication System''.\"\n```\n\nExample 2: Subsections with details\n\n```markdown\n### Frontend: Login Form Component\n\nCreate a new React component at `src/components/LoginForm.tsx`:\n\n- Email and password inputs\n- Submit button with loading state\n- Error message display\n- Validation on submit\n\n### Backend: Auth Routes\n\nAdd to `src/routes/auth.ts`:\n\n- POST /login endpoint\n- Password verification using bcrypt\n- JWT token generation on success\n```\n\nExtracted subtasks:\n\n```bash\ndex create \"Frontend: Login Form Component\" \\\n  --parent abc123 \\\n  --description \"Create a new React component at src/components/LoginForm.tsx with email/password inputs, submit button with loading state, error message display, and validation on submit. This is part of ''Add Authentication System''.\"\n\ndex create \"Backend: Auth Routes\" \\\n  --parent abc123 \\\n  --description \"Add to src/routes/auth.ts: POST /login endpoint, password verification using bcrypt, JWT token generation on success. This is part of ''Add Authentication System''.\"\n```\n\nExample 3: Should NOT break down\n\n```markdown\n# Plan: Fix Typo in Error Message\n\n## Problem\n\nError message says ''Sucessful'' instead of ''Successful''\n\n## Solution\n\nFix typo in src/messages.ts line 42\n```\n\nDecision: Single cohesive task, only one change. Do NOT create subtasks.\n\n### Key Principles\n\n1. Agent judgment is critical: Use intelligence to determine if breakdown adds value\n2. Err on the side of NOT breaking down: Only break down when it clearly helps\n3. Each subtask must be meaningful: Not just a single line change\n4. Context is essential: Each subtask should have enough context to be actionable independently\n5. Preserve plan semantics: Don''t force a structure that doesn''t match the plan''s intent\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:23.187Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing to convert markdown planning documents into trackable tasks.","zh":"非常适合需要将 markdown 规划文档转换为可跟踪任务的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがマークダウン計画文書を追跡可能なタスクに変換する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"마크다운 계획 문서를 추적 가능한 작업으로 변환해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan convertir documentos de planificación de markdown en tareas rastreables.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de convertir des documents de planification markdown en tâches traçables.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die Markdown-Planungsdokumente in nachverfolgbare Aufgaben umwandeln müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento que precisam converter documentos de planejamento em markdown em tarefas rastreáveis.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходимо преобразовывать документы планирования в markdown в отслеживаемые задачи.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الناشئين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحويل مستندات التخطيط بالشكل النصي إلى مهام قابلة للتعقب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert markdown documents to trackable dex tasks using the `dex-plan` command, supporting markdown file formats and integrating with the dex task management system via `npx @zeeg/dex` invocation.","zh":"赋予代理将 markdown 文档转换为可跟踪的 dex 任务的能力，使用 `dex-plan` 命令，支持 markdown 文件格式，并通过 `npx @zeeg/dex` 调用与 dex 任务管理系统集成。","ja":"`dex-plan` コマンドを使用して、マークダウン文書を追跡可能な dex タスクに変換するエージェントを可能にし、マークダウンファイル形式をサポートし、`npx @zeeg/dex` 呼び出しを介して dex タスク管理システムと統合します。","ko":"`dex-plan` 명령을 사용하여 마크다운 문서를 추적 가능한 dex 작업으로 변환하는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 마크다운 파일 형식을 지원하고 `npx @zeeg/dex` 호출을 통해 dex 작업 관리 시스템과 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir documentos markdown en tareas dex rastreables utilizando el comando `dex-plan`, que admite formatos de archivo markdown e integra con el sistema de administración de tareas dex a través de la invocación `npx @zeeg/dex`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des documents markdown en tâches dex traçables en utilisant la commande `dex-plan`, qui prend en charge les formats de fichiers markdown et s''intègre au système de gestion des tâches dex via l''invocation `npx @zeeg/dex`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Markdown-Dokumente in nachverfolgbare dex-Aufgaben mithilfe des `dex-plan`-Befehls umzuwandeln, der Markdown-Dateiformate unterstützt und sich über den Aufruf `npx @zeeg/dex` in das dex-Aufgabenmanagementsystem integriert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter documentos em markdown em tarefas rastreáveis do dex usando o comando `dex-plan`, suportando formatos de arquivo markdown e integrando-se com o sistema de gerenciamento de tarefas do dex via invocação `npx @zeeg/dex`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать документы markdown в отслеживаемые задачи dex с помощью команды `dex-plan`, поддерживая форматы файлов markdown и интегрируясь с системой управления задачами dex через вызов `npx @zeeg/dex`.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل مستندات الشكل النصي إلى مهام قابلة للتعقب من dex باستخدام الأمر `dex-plan` ، ودعم صيغ ملفات الشكل النصي وتكاملها مع نظام إدارة المهام من dex من خلال استدعاء `npx @zeeg/dex`."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting specification documents to trackable tasks","Automating task creation from markdown plans","Tracking progress of markdown-based projects"],"zh":["将规格文档转换为可跟踪任务","自动从 markdown 计划中创建任务","跟踪基于 markdown 的项目的进度"],"ja":["仕様文書を追跡可能なタスクに変換する","マークダウン計画からタスクの自動作成","マークダウンベースのプロジェクトの進度を追跡する"],"ko":["명세서를 추적 가능한 작업으로 변환","마크다운 계획에서 작업 자동 생성","마크다운 기반 프로젝트의 진행 상황 추적"],"es":["Conversión de documentos de especificación en tareas rastreables","Automatización de la creación de tareas a partir de planes markdown","Seguimiento del progreso de proyectos basados en markdown"],"fr":["Conversion de documents de spécification en tâches traçables","Automatisation de la création de tâches à partir de plans markdown","Suivi de la progression de projets basés sur markdown"],"de":["Umwandlung von Spezifikationsdokumenten in nachverfolgbare Aufgaben","Automatisierung der Aufgabenstellung aus Markdown-Plänen","Nachverfolgung des Fortschritts von Markdown-basierten Projekten"],"pt":["Conversão de documentos de especificação em tarefas rastreáveis","Automação da criação de tarefas a partir de planos em markdown","Acompanhamento do progresso de projetos baseados em markdown"],"ru":["Преобразование документов спецификации в отслеживаемые задачи","Автоматизация создания задач из планов markdown","Отслеживание прогресса проектов на основе markdown"],"ar":["تحويل مستندات المواصفات إلى مهام قابلة للتعقب","تحسين автоматيّة إنشاء المهام من خطط الشكل النصي","تتبع تقدم المشاريع المبنية على الشكل النصي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires dex installation and PATH configuration","Markdown documents only","Dependent on `npx @zeeg/dex` availability"],"zh":["需要 dex 安装和 PATH 配置","仅支持 markdown 文档","依赖于 `npx @zeeg/dex` 的可用性"],"ja":["dex のインストールと PATH 設定が必要","マークダウン文書のみをサポート","`npx @zeeg/dex` の可用性に依存"],"ko":["dex 설치 및 PATH 구성이 필요","마크다운 문서만 지원","`npx @zeeg/dex` 가용성에 종속"],"es":["Requiere instalación de dex y configuración de PATH","Solo documentos markdown","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de `npx @zeeg/dex`"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de dex et la configuration de PATH","Documents markdown uniquement","Dépend de la disponibilité de `npx @zeeg/dex`"],"de":["Benötigt dex-Installation und PATH-Konfiguration","Nur Markdown-Dokumente","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit von `npx @zeeg/dex`"],"pt":["Exige instalação do dex e configuração do PATH","Apenas documentos em markdown","Dependente da disponibilidade de `npx @zeeg/dex`"],"ru":["Требует установки dex и конфигурации PATH","Только документы markdown","Зависит от доступности `npx @zeeg/dex`"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت dex وتكوين PATH","مستندات الشكل النصي فقط","يعتمد على توافر `npx @zeeg/dex`"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"030a89261fa36b5ce7eff99c507f22b9a51db17dd9aa1f3f3546f1150130162d","qualityScore":60}');
