ct-specification-writer alternative","project-specification-writer setup guide","what is project-specification-writer","project-specification-writer vs documentation tools","project-specification-writer install","comprehensive specification document generation","project documentation automation","AI agent for project specification"],"zh":["项目规范撰写工具","AI驱动的项目规范文档生成","项目开发效率提高","项目规范文档生成","架构和技术选择","数据模型和伪代码","系统上下文图","容器/部署概述"],"ja":["プロジェクト仕様書作成ツール","AIエージェントによるプロジェクト仕様書生成","プロジェクト開発効率向上","プロジェクト仕様書生成","アーキテクチャと技術選択","データモデルと疑似コード","システムコンテキスト図","コンテナ/デプロイメント概要"],"ko":["프로젝트 규격 작성 도구","AI 기반 프로젝트 규격 문서 생성","프로젝트 개발 효율성 향상","프로젝트 규격 문서 생성","아키텍처와 기술 선택","데이터 모델과 의사 코드","시스템 문脈图","컨테이너/배포 개요"],"es":["Project Specification Writer","especificación de proyectos","generación de documentos","arquitectura de software","modelo de datos","pseudocódigo","diagramas de secuencia","herramientas de desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Project Specification Writer","spécification de projet","génération de documents","architecture logicielle","modèle de données","pseudocode","diagrammes de séquence","outils de développement de logiciel"],"de":["Project Specification Writer","Projektspezifikation","Dokumentenerstellung","Softwarearchitektur","Datenmodell","Pseudocode","Sequenzdiagramme","Software-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["project-specification-writer","documentos de especificação de projeto","arquitetura de software","modelo de dados","pseudocódigo","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["project-specification-writer","документы спецификации проекта","архитектура программного обеспечения","модель данных","псевдокод","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["project-specification-writer","مستندات مواصفات المشروع","هندسة البرمجيات","نموذج البيانات","الكود النصي","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"sinjie2008","repo":"Foundational-Electronics-Core-Systems","repoPath":"sinjie2008/Foundational-Electronics-Core-Systems","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.434Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-specification-writer","description":"Generate a complete software specification document for the current project/repo, including architecture, data model, key processes, pseudocode, and Mermaid diagrams (context, container/deployment, module relations, sequence, ER, class, flowchart, state).","bodyPreview":"# Project Specification Writer (Instruction-only)\n\n## Goal\nWhen invoked, produce a **single, comprehensive specification document** for the **current repository/project** with **all required sections**:\n\n1. Architecture and technology choices  \n2. Data model  \n3. Key processes  \n4. Pseudocode  \n5. System context diagram  \n6. Container/deployment overview  \n7. Module relationship diagram (Backend / Frontend)  \n8. Sequence diagram  \n9. ER diagram  \n10. Class diagram (key backend classes)  \n11. Flo","body":"# Project Specification Writer (Instruction-only)\n\n## Goal\nWhen invoked, produce a **single, comprehensive specification document** for the **current repository/project** with **all required sections**:\n\n1. Architecture and technology choices  \n2. Data model  \n3. Key processes  \n4. Pseudocode  \n5. System context diagram  \n6. Container/deployment overview  \n7. Module relationship diagram (Backend / Frontend)  \n8. Sequence diagram  \n9. ER diagram  \n10. Class diagram (key backend classes)  \n11. Flowchart  \n12. State diagram  \n\n**Default output file:** `docs/specification.md`  \n(If `docs/` does not exist, create it. If user requests another path, follow it.)\n\n---\n\n## Invocation behavior\n### Minimal questions policy\nAsk **at most 5** clarifying questions **only if** the repo does not contain enough information to avoid unsafe guessing.  \nIf information is missing, proceed with best-effort inference and add an **“Assumptions & Open Questions”** section near the top.\n\n### No hallucinations rule\nDo **not** invent details. If you cannot locate evidence in the repo, label as:\n- **Assumption**\n- **Unknown/TBD**\n- **Open question**\n\n---\n\n## Repo reconnaissance workflow (do this first)\n1. Identify repo root and high-level structure:\n   - Look for: `README*`, `docs/`, `architecture/`, `ADR*`, `design*`, `SPEC*`.\n2. Detect tech stack and runtime:\n   - Backend signals: `pyproject.toml`, `requirements.txt`, `go.mod`, `pom.xml`, `build.gradle`, `.csproj`, `package.json` (server), `Dockerfile`\n   - Frontend signals: `package.json`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`, `yarn.lock`, `vite.config.*`, `next.config.*`\n3. Detect data layer:\n   - DB migrations: `migrations/`, `prisma/schema.prisma`, `alembic/`, `db/schema.sql`, `knexfile.*`\n   - ORM models: `models/`, `entities/`, `schema/`\n4. Detect deployment:\n   - `docker-compose.yml`, `Dockerfile*`, `k8s/`, `helm/`, `.github/workflows/*`, `terraform/`\n5. Collect “evidence pointers” while reading (file paths + brief notes).  \n   You will use these pointers throughout the spec.\n\n---\n\n## Output requirements (strict)\n- Produce **one Markdown document**.\n- Use **clear headings** matching the 12 required items.\n- All diagrams must be in fenced Mermaid blocks:  \n  \\`\\`\\`mermaid  \n  ...  \n  \\`\\`\\`\n- Each section must be **project-specific** (grounded in repo findings).\n- Keep diagrams at the right abstraction level:\n  - **Context/Container**: high-level systems and deployed containers/services\n  - **Module diagram**: major frontend/backend modules and their dependencies\n  - **Class diagram**: only key backend classes (5–15), not every class\n\n---\n\n# Specification Document Template (write exactly this structure)\n\n# {{Project Name}} — Specification\n**Version:** {{date}}  \n**Repo:** {{repo identifier if known}}  \n**Primary stack:** {{inferred stack}}  \n\n## Assumptions & Open Questions\n- Assumption: ...\n- Open question: ...\n\n## 1. Architecture and technology choices\n### 1.1 Architecture overview\n- System style (e.g., monolith, modular monolith, microservices)\n- Key components and responsibilities\n- Trust boundaries (auth, secrets, network zones) if applicable\n\n### 1.2 Technology choices (with rationale)\nProvide a table:\n| Area | Choice | Evidence | Why this choice | Alternatives considered |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n\n### 1.3 Non-functional requirements (NFRs)\n- Performance, availability, security, observability, compliance, cost\n- What the repo suggests (or what’s missing)\n\n## 2. Data model\n### 2.1 Conceptual model\n- List core entities and what they represent\n- Identify ownership and lifecycle boundaries\n\n### 2.2 Logical model (tables/collections)\nProvide a table:\n| Entity/Table | Primary key | Key fields | Relationships | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n\n### 2.3 Data integrity & constraints\n- Uniqueness, foreign keys, soft delete, audit fields, tenancy strategy, etc.\n\n## 3. Key processes\nList 3–7 “key processes” (system behaviors) using this structure:\n- **Process name**\n  - Trigger:\n  - Inputs:\n  - Outputs:\n  - Key steps:\n  - Error cases:\n  - Observability (logs/metrics/traces):\n\n## 4. Pseudocode\nFor each key process, provide pseudocode:\n- Use clear function signatures\n- Include validation, error handling, retries/transactions where relevant\n\nExample format:\n```text\nfunction ProcessName(input):\n  validate input\n  begin transaction (if needed)\n  ...\n  return result\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:36.212Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Productivity Agents needing automated technical documentation generation.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化技术文档生成的开发者生产力代理。","ja":"自動化された技術文書の生成が必要な開発者生産性エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 기술 문서 생성이 필요한 개발자 생산성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Productividad de Desarrolladores que necesitan generación automática de documentación técnica.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Productivité des Développeurs ayant besoin de génération automatique de documentation technique.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickler-Produktivitätsagenten, die automatisierte technische Dokumentenerstellung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Produtividade de Desenvolvedores que necessitam de geração automatizada de documentação técnica.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов производительности разработчиков, которым требуется автоматизированная генерация технической документации.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إنتاجية المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد وثائق فنية آلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Generates comprehensive specification documents including architecture diagrams, data models, and key processes from repository analysis. Provides automated system context diagrams, ER diagrams, and sequence diagrams for complete project documentation.","zh":"从存储库分析生成包括体系结构图、数据模型和关键流程在内的综合规格文档。为完整的项目文档提供自动化的系统上下文图、ER图和序列图。","ja":"リポジトリの分析から、体系構成図、データモデル、主なプロセスを含む包括的な仕様書を生成します。 完全なプロジェクトの文書化のために、自動化されたシステムのコンテキスト図、ER図、シーケンス図を提供します。","ko":"리포지토리 분석에서 아키텍처 다이어그램, 데이터 모델, 주요 프로세스를 포함한 포괄적인 사양 문서를 생성합니다. 완벽한 프로젝트 문서화를 위해 자동화된 시스템 컨텍스트 다이어그램, ER 다이어그램, 시퀀스 다이어그램을 제공합니다.","es":"Genera documentos de especificación comprehensivos que incluyen diagramas de arquitectura, modelos de datos y procesos clave a partir del análisis de repositorios. Proporciona diagramas de contexto del sistema, diagramas ER y diagramas de secuencia automatizados para la documentación completa del proyecto.","fr":"Génère des documents de spécification complets comprenant des diagrammes d''architecture, des modèles de données et des processus clés à partir de l''analyse des référentiels. Fournit des diagrammes de contexte du système, des diagrammes ER et des diagrammes de séquence automatisés pour la documentation complète du projet.","de":"Erzeugt umfassende Spezifikationsdokumente, einschließlich Architekturdiagrammen, Datenmodellen und Schlüsselprozessen aus der Repository-Analyse. Bietet automatisierte Systemkontextdiagramme, ER-Diagramme und Sequenzdiagramme für die vollständige Projekt-Dokumentation.","pt":"Gera documentos de especificação abrangentes, incluindo diagramas de arquitetura, modelos de dados e processos principais a partir da análise do repositório. Fornece diagramas de contexto do sistema automatizados, diagramas ER e diagramas de sequência para documentação de projeto completa.","ru":"Генерирует полные спецификационные документы, включая диаграммы архитектуры, модели данных и ключевые процессы из анализа репозитория. Предоставляет автоматизированные контекстные диаграммы системы, диаграммы ER и последовательные диаграммы для полной документации проекта.","ar":"ينشئ وثائق مواصفات شاملة، بما في ذلك رسومات الهيكل، ونماذج البيانات، والعمليات الرئيسية من تحليل المستودع. يوفر رسومات السياق الآلي للنظام، ورسومات ER، ورسومات التتابع لتوثيق المشروع الكامل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating technical documentation for new repositories","Generating architecture diagrams for system reviews","Creating data model documentation for database migrations","Producing deployment overviews for DevOps planning"],"zh":["自动化新存储库的技术文档","为系统审查生成架构图","为数据库迁移创建数据模型文档","为DevOps规划生成部署概述"],"ja":["新しいリポジトリの技術文書の自動化","システムレビューのためのアーキテクチャ図の生成","データベース移行のためのデータモデル文書の作成","DevOps計画のためのデプロイの概要の生成"],"ko":["새로운 리포지토리의 기술 문서 자동화","시스템 리뷰를 위한 아키텍처 다이어그램 생성","데이터베이스 마이그레이션을 위한 데이터 모델 문서 생성","DevOps 계획을 위한 배포 개요 생성"],"es":["Automatizar la documentación técnica para nuevos repositorios","Generar diagramas de arquitectura para revisiones del sistema","Crear documentación de modelo de datos para migraciones de bases de datos","Producir informes de implementación para la planificación de DevOps"],"fr":["Automatiser la documentation technique pour les nouveaux référentiels","Générer des diagrammes d''architecture pour les examens du système","Créer une documentation de modèle de données pour les migrations de bases de données","Produire des aperçus de déploiement pour la planification DevOps"],"de":["Automatisierung der technischen Dokumentation für neue Repositories","Erzeugen von Architekturdiagrammen für Systemüberprüfungen","Erstellen von Datenmodell-Dokumentationen für Datenbankmigrationen","Erzeugen von Bereitstellungsübersichten für die DevOps-Planung"],"pt":["Automatizar a documentação técnica para novos repositórios","Gerar diagramas de arquitetura para revisões do sistema","Criar documentação de modelo de dados para migrações de banco de dados","Produzir visões gerais de implantação para planejamento DevOps"],"ru":["Автоматизировать техническую документацию для новых репозиториев","Генерировать диаграммы архитектуры для обзоров системы","Создавать документацию модели данных для миграций базы данных","Производить обзоры развертывания для планирования DevOps"],"ar":["توفير وثائق فنية آلية للمستودعات الجديدة","إنشاء رسومات هيكل للنظام لاستعراض النظام","إنشاء وثائق نموذج البيانات لمهاجرات قاعدة البيانات","إنتاج نظرة عامة على النشر لتحديد الخدمات DevOps"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to complete repository structure","Depends on codebase clarity for accurate diagram generation","Limited to analyzing accessible project files"],"zh":["需要访问完整的存储库结构","依赖于代码库清晰度以生成准确的图表","仅限于分析可访问的项目文件"],"ja":["完全なリポジトリ構造へのアクセスが必要","正確な図の生成のためにコードベースの明確さに依存","アクセス可能なプロジェクトファイルの分析のみ"],"ko":["완전한 리포지토리 구조에 대한 액세스가 필요","정확한 다이어그램 생성을 위해 코드베이스의 명확도에 의존","액세스 가능한 프로젝트 파일의 분석만"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la estructura completa del repositorio","Depende de la claridad del código base para la generación precisa de diagramas","Limitado al análisis de archivos de proyecto accesibles"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la structure complète du référentiel","Dépend de la clarté du code base pour la génération précise de diagrammes","Limité à l''analyse des fichiers de projet accessibles"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die vollständige Repository-Struktur","Hängt von der Klarheit des Codebases für die genaue Diagrammerstellung ab","Begrenzt auf die Analyse zugänglicher Projektdateien"],"pt":["Requer acesso à estrutura completa do repositório","Depende da clareza do código-fonte para geração precisa de diagramas","Limitado à análise de arquivos de projeto acessíveis"],"ru":["Требует доступа к полной структуре репозитория","Зависит от ясности кодовой базы для точной генерации диаграмм","Ограничен анализом доступных файлов проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى هيكل المستودع الكامل","يعتمد على وضوح قاعدة الشفرة لتوليد رسومات دقيقة","محدود بتحليل الملفات القابلة للوصول للمشروع"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"363693d36287063a00947b8881b3224308f5b5d73846ea4cbf46d66aadd2f89d","qualityScore":60}');
