INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('kubrickcode/specvital/validate-parser', 'validate-parser', 'kubrickcode', 'specvital', 'community', 'validate-parser kubrickcode specvital community The validate-parser skill operates within the lib directory, providing real-world parser validation for SpecVital Core parser. It benefits developers working with parser integration and validation. validate-parser 是一个用于验证解析器的 AI 代理技能，提供解析器验证命令和报告输出 validate-parser は、パーサーを検証する AI エージェント スキルであり、パーサー検証コマンドと報告出力を提供する validate-parser는 파서를 검증하는 AI 에이전트 스킬로 파서 유효성 검사 명령과 보고서 출력을 제공합니다 Validate-parser es una herramienta de validación de parsers que opera dentro de lib, permitiendo a los desarrolladores verificar la integridad de sus parsers Validate-parser est un outil de validation de parsers qui fonctionne à l''intérieur de lib, permettant aux développeurs de vérifier l''intégrité de leurs parsers Validate-parser ist ein Validierungstool für Parser, das innerhalb von lib arbeitet und es Entwicklern ermöglicht, die Integrität ihrer Parser zu überprüfen O validate-parser é uma ferramenta de validação de parser que opera exclusivamente dentro do lib, com recursos de integração e testes. Validate-parser - это инструмент валидации парсера, работающий исключительно внутри lib, с возможностями интеграции и тестирования. validate-parser هو أداة التحقق من صحة parser التي تعمل حصريًا داخل lib، مع ميزات التكامل والاختبار. how to use validate-parser validate-parser setup guide what is validate-parser validate-parser alternative validate-parser vs parserlint validate-parser install SpecVital Core parser validation lib directory parser integration parser validation best practices AI 代理 validate-parser 解析器验证 lib integration tests repos.yaml justfile ADR 文档 Operates exclusively within the lib directory for SpecVital Core parser Utilizes source code from lib/parser/, lib/crypto/, and lib/source/ Supports integration tests via lib/parser/tests/integration/ References repos.yaml for repository configuration Generates reports based on parser validation results Leverages justfile for streamlined command execution validate-parser is a skill that validates parsers within the lib directory, utilizing source code from lib/parser/, lib/crypto/, and lib/source/.');
